- AC-A2 (PRD AC-11): `{nudgeMuted:true}` persists on that series only and is returned; other series, the occurrence row and every Reminder row unchanged; `false` persists; travels with a template edit.
- AC-A3 (PRD AC-11): non-boolean ("true", 1, 0, null, {}) → 400 naming nudgeMuted, row byte-equal before/after even with a valid sibling field; unknown extra key keeps the existing rejection and nudgeMuted is not applied; `nudgedAt` is not an editable key.
