- AC-A5 (PRD AC-14): GET /api/export recurrence_series rows carry nudgeMuted (boolean) and nudgedAt (epoch seconds or null).
- AC-A6 (PRD AC-11): create/list/read/patch responses expose nudgeMuted and never the key nudgedAt, even with a marker set in D1.

